  "details": [
   {
    "heading": "Summary",
    "text": "Keep the casualty, tactical leadership and the evacuation system informed."
   },
   {
    "heading": "Key points",
    "items": [
     "Talk to the casualty if possible: encourage, reassure and explain care. (p. 13)",
     "Update tactical leadership early and throughout, with casualty status and evacuation requirements. (p. 13)",
     "Contact the evacuation system (the Patient Evacuation Coordination Cell) to arrange TACEVAC, and if possible tell the evacuation providers the mechanism of injury, injuries, signs/symptoms and treatments. (p. 13)"
    ]
   }
  ],
